<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105612" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροχίζω</span></b> , fut.
		
			Att.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιῶ</span>
		<u>AP</u> (v. infr.): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροχός</span>)
			:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>break on the
				wheel, torture,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.180
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i>) :—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				1.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1153b19
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τροχοῦ κατατμηθῆναι ἢ
					καταθραυσθῆναι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				p.114B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>furnish with wheels,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Bito
				58.3
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>run round,</i> or perh. <i>take carriage exercise,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				935b29
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
